OL,6,     FMaria Kargbo grew up in Sierra
OL,7,     FLeone watching Chinese opera on
OL,8,     Fher friends' TVs. Years later, she
OL,9,     Fwould find herself performing for
OL,10,     Fmillions on China's biggest talent
OL,11,     Fshow.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1994, a French curator helped
OL,14,     Frecover documents thought lost
OL,15,     Fsince World War Two. They came
OL,16,     Ffrom a Nazi research project
OL,17,     Ffocused on the Bayeux Tapestry.
